{"unit_id":"LISparrowC1__dsh-loop-guard#card-zh","repo":"LISparrowC1/dsh-loop-guard","commit":"fc7f334591aa2995667eb1ef29f34c26865605ce","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-loop-guard 是一款 DSH 插件，通过流式输出和工具执行钩子守护长时间运行的 agent。它识别连续重复的模型文本和覆盖滚动窗口的大段重复内容，在相似工具调用反复作用于同一目标时提醒模型并可停止轮次，也能按调用数、步骤数、时长和文字输出量限制失控轮次。它适合希望避免 agent 无进展循环或不必要消耗的 DSH 用户。可用配置文件即时覆盖阈值，并将事件记录到本地；无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:165-180","lib/guard.js:47-67","lib/detector.js:156-180"]}
{"unit_id":"LISparrowC1__dsh-loop-guard#card-en","repo":"LISparrowC1/dsh-loop-guard","commit":"fc7f334591aa2995667eb1ef29f34c26865605ce","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-loop-guard detects repeated model output and tool loops in DSH. It warns on repeated calls to the same target and can stop the turn. Limits cover calls, steps, time, and generated text. Users can change settings live from a local file and review local event logs.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:165-180","lib/guard.js:47-67","lib/detector.js:156-180"]}
