{"unit_id":"LISparrowC1__dsh-loop-guard#feature-1","repo":"LISparrowC1/dsh-loop-guard","commit":"fc7f334591aa2995667eb1ef29f34c26865605ce","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-loop-guard 的功能「重复文本检测」：实时扫描模型输出的滚动文本窗口，周期检测和分片检测命中重复时结束当前尝试并进入有次数上限的重试流程。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/detector.js:156-180","lib/index.js:165-168"]}
{"unit_id":"LISparrowC1__dsh-loop-guard#feature-2","repo":"LISparrowC1/dsh-loop-guard","commit":"fc7f334591aa2995667eb1ef29f34c26865605ce","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-loop-guard 的功能「工具循环识别」：工具执行后比较连续调用的工具与目标，近似重复或循环达到提醒阈值时向模型注入提示，达到硬阈值时可取消本轮。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/guard.js:22-39","lib/guard.js:300-350"]}
{"unit_id":"LISparrowC1__dsh-loop-guard#feature-3","repo":"LISparrowC1/dsh-loop-guard","commit":"fc7f334591aa2995667eb1ef29f34c26865605ce","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-loop-guard 的功能「轮次预算限制」：按每小时调用数、单轮步数、持续分钟数和模型文字输出量限制工作；达到限制时在模型调用前拒绝或中断当前尝试。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/guard.js:47-67","lib/guard.js:206-260"]}
{"unit_id":"LISparrowC1__dsh-loop-guard#feature-4","repo":"LISparrowC1/dsh-loop-guard","commit":"fc7f334591aa2995667eb1ef29f34c26865605ce","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-loop-guard 的功能「即时配置覆盖」：每次守卫决策时读取本地 loop-guard/config.json，将其与入口配置合并，修改阈值或开关后可在下一次模型调用生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:101-103","lib/index.js:131-153","lib/guard.js:121-147"]}
{"unit_id":"LISparrowC1__dsh-loop-guard#feature-5","repo":"LISparrowC1/dsh-loop-guard","commit":"fc7f334591aa2995667eb1ef29f34c26865605ce","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-loop-guard 的功能「事件记录」：守卫加载和判定事件会输出到插件日志，并可追加写入本地 loop-guard/events.jsonl，供用户查看中断和覆盖配置记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:101-118","lib/index.js:170-180"]}
